  <item>
    <title>堇学座042：毕业的钟声：天真みちる的花样宝塚生涯第二幕（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668410cacdd230b23bc294f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668410cacdd230b23bc294f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jul 2024 14:38:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>堇学座第一季结束啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>别看我这样，我可是宝塚毕业的（こう見えて元タカラジェンヌです）</span></p><span></span><p><span>天真みちる　著</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是天真宝塚生涯的Finale，是她从退団意识产生，到最后退団的历程。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场音：天真退団公演西千致辞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:00:16</a> 开场白：堇学座第一季完结撒花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">00:08:29</a> 近三年的退団酝酿期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">00:11:21</a> 上级生的枷锁，登台的恐惧，来自正塚的拯救&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">00:17:14</a> 作为演员的“天真特色”与干冰梦想的实现&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">00:21:01</a> 人生第一次和组P谈判：请务必让我进那个公演，务必让我演那个角色！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">00:24:19</a> 你考虑自己就好，宝塚离了谁都会照样转动的&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">00:25:21</a> 为了专心和演出家对峙，这个剧还不能退</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">00:27:23</a> 一生中最紧张的一天&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">00:28:08</a> 天真的文字版“最后一天”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">00:34:48</a> 收梢音：Memories of 天真みちる 结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
