  <item>
    <title>堇学座041：天真的舞台事故们：天真みちる的花样宝塚生涯第二幕（中）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66719d5ec26e396a36b7d00e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66719d5ec26e396a36b7d00e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 14:44:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>别看我这样，我可是宝塚毕业的（こう見えて元タカラジェンヌです）</span></p><span></span><p><span>天真みちる　著</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期说说天真宝塚职业生涯事故大合集。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些尬出天际的事，那些把天真逼急了的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期关联人物：太田哲则、生田大和、鞠花ゆめ、紅ゆずる、龍真咲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场曲：愛の祈り的前奏（鞠花ゆめ、天真みちる）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:00:14</a> 开场白：悲剧之后，关于宝塚的叙事维度增多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">00:08:28</a> 自身追求与剧团要求的错位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">00:12:56</a> “连TOP换装都没有四个人服侍啊。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">00:16:35</a> 差点退团和“媚眼量产机”的诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">00:21:28</a> 泳帽事件：从同志到神様的生田大和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">00:25:02</a> 说自己的台词，让别人无词可说 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1711">00:28:31</a> 上级生们的慷慨与善意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1972">00:32:52</a> 可疑的莫西干头与可疑的卷心菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2039">00:33:59</a> “你这个样子完全不是娘役啊！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2282">00:38:02</a> 有生以来第一次被放到中心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">00:40:39</a> 收梢曲：愛の祈り（鞠花ゆめ、天真みちる）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>愛の祈り（鞠花ゆめ、天真みちる）</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
