  <item>
    <title>堇学座038：音校怎么考？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6638ca8248dbc98b896247ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6638ca8248dbc98b896247ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 May 2024 12:18:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>考宝塚，世界独一无二的梦想（宝塚受験　世界にひとつしかない夢）</span></p><span></span><p><span>川路真瑳　著</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享川路的这本书，也分享这本书里提到的音校考试全流程。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场曲：宝塚音乐学校校歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:00:30</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">00:01:41</a> 有人得到金条，有人得到芭蕾 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">00:05:58</a> 梦想的实现与否并非尽头，自我教育才是一辈子的事&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">00:10:58</a> 零基础更好教&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">00:14:28</a> 不是有钱人家能考宝塚吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">00:18:37</a> 考音校全流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">00:34:48</a> 收梢曲：宝塚音乐学校校歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>宝塚音乐学校校歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
