  <item>
    <title>堇学座037：宝塚的时光，七成是痛苦，三成是无处可寻的剧烈幸福：《堇花再开时》阅读分享（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660ce6064d668feb41a0dea8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660ce6064d668feb41a0dea8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 05:15:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>すみれの花、また咲く頃</span></p><span></span><p><span>早花まこ　著</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分享：美城れん（原星组→专科男役）、煌月爽矢（原月组男役）、夢乃聖夏（原星组→雪组男役）</span></p><span></span><p><span>终于能把早花这本书分享完了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是……三位奇人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场曲：愛の輝き（夢乃聖夏）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:00:31</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">00:05:28</a> 美城れん的故事&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">00:21:30</a> 煌月爽矢的故事&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">00:32:41</a> 夢乃聖夏的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">00:42:55</a> 宝塚是我们自己的语言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2703">00:45:03</a> 收梢曲：Bridge Over Troubled Water（美城れん）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>愛の輝き（夢乃聖夏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bridge Over Troubled Water（美城れん）</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
