  <item>
    <title>堇学座036：正是在宝塚，我成就了不是自己的自己：《堇花再开时》阅读分享（中）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f8672667649570791a3d17</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f8672667649570791a3d17</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Mar 2024 16:09:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>すみれの花、また咲く頃</span></p><span></span><p><span>早花まこ　著</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分享：香綾しずる（原雪组男役）、鳳真由（原花组男役）、風馬翔（原宙组男役）</span></p><span></span><p><span>和上期分享的三位不同，本期的三位都没有TOP的光环，翔老师甚至也不是路线生，但她们的故事同样精彩。她们的经历、选择向读者展示了，即便在宝塚内部，价值取向也不是一元的，世人眼中的所谓成功，并不适用于每个人。她们都爱着宝塚，但爱的方式迥异。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场曲：ANOTHER LIFE（香綾しずる）开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:00:37</a> 宝塚在生徒们生命里的职责和功能是不同的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">00:03:18</a> 新公主役让老高意识到自己并不适合站在中间&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">00:08:50</a> 老高没想到，宝塚经验竟以这种方式作用于异国&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">00:11:55</a> 间隔曲：ANOTHER LIFE（香綾しずる）完整后半</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">00:13:54</a> 佛系生徒P酱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">00:16:27</a> 被具象化了的憧憬，并不都是美好的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">00:17:54</a> P酱三事：第一次新公主役、“我就不想当TOP”、“先别急着退团……我想和你一起努力下去”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">00:23:23</a> 离开宝塚，去实现儿时的梦想&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">00:26:12</a> 翔老师：我在哪里起舞，哪里对我来说就是舞台的中心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">00:31:17</a> 男役的舞，比想象的难多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2086">00:34:46</a> “我想知道天使的心情是怎样的，你能告诉我吗？”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2223">00:37:03</a> 一年走遍日本只为舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">00:39:44</a> 人生最痛苦的时候，就去排练场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">00:41:50</a> 收梢曲：空も飛べるはず（風馬翔）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>ANOTHER LIFE（香綾しずる）</span></p><span></span><p><span>空も飛べるはず（風馬翔）</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
