  <item>
    <title>堇学座035：宝塚没有正确答案，但有终极追求：《堇花再开时》阅读分享（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e7031c8d5665c0089a36a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e7031c8d5665c0089a36a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2024 11:33:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>すみれの花、また咲く頃</span></p><span></span><p><span>早花まこ　著</span></p><span></span><p><span>九位OG访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每篇访谈基本采用入团动机、在团时和退团后这样的内容结构，展现的是这些女性动人的生命轨迹。她们既信念坚定、可以不顾一切放手追逐，比如考音校，又是不断自省和修正的，包括对宝塚生活本身的反思。没有一个人是停留在回忆往昔的，也没有一个人是停止成长的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分享三位：早霧せいな　咲妃みゆ　仙名彩世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场白：一只彻底活过来的阿布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">00:04:47</a> 造梦的人活在诗意稀薄的地方&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">00:08:43</a> &nbsp;chigi印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">00:12:20</a> &nbsp;关于“零”的矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">00:16:28</a> 祈祷的少女与学习爱的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">00:19:56</a> 十多年不见，宝塚的孩子都进化成这样了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">00:22:42</a> 竟然考上了，怎么办啊……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">00:27:15</a> 我要你和我并肩而立，两人一起看向前方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">00:30:34</a> 关于演戏，从未体会过“成就感”这种东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">00:34:58</a> 没有人会注意的火绒草花冠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2288">00:38:08</a> 你现在是为了什么而笑？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>もしも明日が</span></p><span></span><p><span>PIECE OF MY WISH</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
