  <item>
    <title>堇学座032：眼泪流一天就足够了：“不死鸟”宝塚历劫记（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ede029e490c5dee5c9a31c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ede029e490c5dee5c9a31c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Aug 2023 12:10:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期聊聊宝塚迄今109年的历史中经历过的数次直接受损或导致公演中止的重大劫难，它们或来自自然的暴力，比如地震；或来自人类的暴力，比如战争；或来自自然的威力与人类的愚蠢疏忽的叠加，比如火灾和疫情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主要是史实梳理，包括灾难的发生，宝塚的损失和应对。宝塚这近110年，有起落，有浮沉，有兴衰，有力挽狂澜的壮举，也有错误百出的策略；有资本与时代共同造就的繁荣与辉煌，也有多次天灾人祸带来的置之死地而后生。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 聊这个话题的原因；虚无中的希望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">00:05:35</a> 仅用2个月就建成的3层楼临时剧场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">00:11:07</a> 宝塚生徒缝制的“慰问袋”里还有绘本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">00:14:04</a> 幸好有火灾保险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">00:15:06</a> 战争来了，剧场关了，但公演从未停止</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">00:20:57</a> 少女们把宝塚大剧场“要”回来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1411">00:23:31</a> 就算削减自己组的公演日程，也要让yan有个完整的西边再见公演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">00:28:56</a> 开还是不开，演还是不演？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>Walk him up the stairs</span></p><span></span><p><span>心の翼</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt45sbKUlSS9Xtm-TIZ_cwM3oYF5.m4a" length="34797503" type="audio/mp4"/>
