  <item>
    <title>堇学座031：对“新作主义”的宝塚来说，“再演”意味着什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64db0b2de490c5dee57ad5bf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64db0b2de490c5dee57ad5bf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Aug 2023 05:20:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期聊聊宝塚的“再演”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊聊对宝塚这样一个以不断创作新剧目为演出命脉的剧团来说，“再演”意味着什么，它为宝塚带来了什么？频繁再演会不会让宝塚显出缺乏创造力的陈旧气象？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 先唠几句kiki和saku的前披，以及星组《1789》新人公演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">00:06:23</a> 再演不是一部剧的简单复活和重生，而是一种转世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">00:11:50</a> 花组《只有两个人的战场》好到跪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">00:15:18</a> &nbsp;宝塚“再演”的类型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">00:18:12</a> “再演”对创作者（演出家）的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">00:22:50</a> “再演”对表演者（生徒）、观众、剧团经营者而言的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">00:24:55</a> 经典“再演”个案：令和大剧场版《泡沫之恋》</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>うたかたの恋</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll-nKmOrupux6ONzz5U_jfCR7evF.m4a" length="27833044" type="audio/mp4"/>
