  <item>
    <title>堇学座030：值得全书背诵的冷热知识宝典《宝塚语辞典》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c8e899b3f6c440a89a3977</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c8e899b3f6c440a89a3977</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Aug 2023 11:12:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期推荐一本书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚读完不久的诚文堂新光社出版、漫画家春原弥生的《宝塚语辞典》。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 科普交织八卦，八卦蕴含历史，值得塚饭全书背诵的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">00:04:18</a> 常规语不常规</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">00:07:39</a> 常规宝塚语和塚圈黑话：変わり燕尾、使い回し、おとなり歩き……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="977">00:16:17</a> 选词角度刁钻到连这两个词也有 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1019">00:16:59</a> 看点一：优秀的结构与角角落落都填满冷知识的丰富度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">00:20:42</a> 看点二：严肃八卦与真情吐槽（如：宝塚四大都市传说）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">00:28:12</a> 看点三：与文字的重要性比肩的超超超灵魂插画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">00:32:32</a> 两大缺点。但无损其好看！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">00:33:23</a> “沼”</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>タカラヅカ・グローリー!</span></p><span></span><p><span>上线平台：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙（音频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站（视频）</span></p><span></span><p><span>发布时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每两周的周二或周三</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播、编辑、后期：lulu（阿布）</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@Endoriel布</span></p>]]></description>
